        "abstract": "It is my honor to be elected as IEEE CIS VP-Member Activities for the years 2025-2026. I have been a member of the IEEE CIS since 1998. Since joining the IEEE CIS, I have been involved with the IEEE CIS technical, educational and membership activities for several years. I also take part in several of our prestigious conferences and journals. I would like to thank Prof. James Keller who inspired me to get involved with these activities.",
        "keywords": {
            "Index Terms": [
                "Years Of Activity",
                "Social Media Interactions",
                "Prestigious Journals"
            ]
        }
