        "abstract": "DeLiang Wang received the B.S. degree and the M.S. degree from Peking (Beijing) University and the Ph.D. degree in 1991 from the University of Southern California, all in computer science. From July 1986 to December 1987, he was with the Institute of Computing Technology, Academia Sinica, Beijing. Since 1991, he has been with the Department of Computer Science & Engineering and the Center for Cognitive and Brain Sciences at The Ohio State University, where he is a Professor and University Distinguished Scholar. He has been a visiting professor to Harvard University, Oticon A/S, Starkey Hearing Technologies, and Northwestern Polytechnical University.",
